OL,3,GNEWSAWork begins to turn derelict
OL,4,Acourthouse into museum
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe #14.5m transformation of a derelict
OL,7,Fcourthouse building into the new home
OL,8,Fof a county museum has begun.
OL,10,FThe Grade II* listed Assize Court in
OL,11,FDevizes, Wiltshire, was built in 1835
OL,12,Fand has been unused since it closed in
OL,13,Fthe 1980s.
OL,15,FIt is expected to reopen in 2030 as the
OL,16,Fnew home of Wiltshire Museum - which is
OL,17,Fcurrently based in a smaller building
OL,18,Fin the town and has a number of
OL,19,Fcollections, including gold items found
OL,20,Fin burial sites near Stonehenge.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
