OL,3,GNEWSAWork begins to turn derelict
OL,4,Acourthouse into museum
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe preliminary works will last for
OL,7,Fabout 12 weeks and prepare the historic
OL,8,Fbuilding ahead of the main works which
OL,9,Fare due to start early next year.
OL,10,FAssizes for Devizes Programme Manager
OL,11,FNicola Trowell said it was a
OL,12,F"monumental" first step.
